{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/ce4d598e6b85c97586b653b325d2cd2c.avif?t=1773208176\" width=431 height=128 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command nine Olympian deities, including Zeus, Hades, Apollo, and Ares. In each run, select three gods to form your unique divine council. Your choice defines how you intervene in the world: heal wounds and convert believers with Apollo\u2019s melody, resurrect the dead with Hades\u2019 power, or strike with Zeus\u2019 thunderbolts. These diverse synergies form the strategic foundation of every playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/8b2d1ffb31d9de7eb2741b3f0d01dee1.poster.avif?t=1773208176\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/8b2d1ffb31d9de7eb2741b3f0d01dee1.webm?t=1773208176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/8b2d1ffb31d9de7eb2741b3f0d01dee1.mp4?t=1773208176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/68ec23c0a079a74c2a990d4ff14f14e6.avif?t=1773208176\" width=431 height=128 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this randomly generated sandbox, every human is a unique individual with their own name and traits. You can play as a passive observer, watching them work and grow naturally, or actively intervene. Use divine powers to create resources, boost the population, or grant technological revelations, guiding your people from scattered settlements into fortified city-states.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/fe38bc99bf10fb5772d76b95e2280e5f.poster.avif?t=1773208176\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/fe38bc99bf10fb5772d76b95e2280e5f.webm?t=1773208176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/fe38bc99bf10fb5772d76b95e2280e5f.mp4?t=1773208176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/4345c45797122cff532323b509091b10.avif?t=1773208176\" width=431 height=128 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faith is the vital link between god and mortal. Perform miracles to inspire the populace, converting them into loyal believers to generate &quot;Faith.&quot; This resource is essential for unlocking and upgrading your divine abilities. Listen to prayers at your temples; answering these pleas allows you to activate powerful artifacts that grant global bonuses to your civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/ee5a1be120a0a92da4c043266cb55e89.poster.avif?t=1773208176\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/ee5a1be120a0a92da4c043266cb55e89.webm?t=1773208176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/ee5a1be120a0a92da4c043266cb55e89.mp4?t=1773208176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/e6b1453c0109bbdd31db62dd07951b12.avif?t=1773208176\" width=431 height=128 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Growth invites conflict. Over time, heretic factions and hostile city-states will rise to compete for land and followers. How you deal with these threats is up to you: guide your faithful armies in a &quot;Holy War&quot; to conquer them, or simply use your divine wrath to smite their cities from the map, ensuring the purity of your faith.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/d676ac037c3d34c1507612bd267bb3bb.poster.avif?t=1773208176\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/d676ac037c3d34c1507612bd267bb3bb.webm?t=1773208176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/d676ac037c3d34c1507612bd267bb3bb.mp4?t=1773208176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/e86f9a23f36104f201ba492921618439.avif?t=1773208176\" width=431 height=128 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 189 skill combinations, no two runs are alike. Experiment with different deity rosters, upgrade paths, and artifact synergies to discover new playstyles. Combined with procedural maps and terrain challenges, every attempt to build a civilization offers a fresh strategic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3030190?t=1773208176","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3030190?t=1773208176","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/906d2c1275a1f720deb23674dfb82e07b6585187/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773208176","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/906d2c1275a1f720deb23674dfb82e07b6585187/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773208176","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3405650,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>PLAY DEMO NOW!</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Overview</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Approx. 2 Hours of Gameplay:</strong> A substantial demo offering a solid, complete playthrough of the early game experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomly Generated Worlds:</strong> Assemble a team of 4 Ancient Greek gods and build civilizations from scratch across 7 randomly generated survival planes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Civilization Guidance &amp; Faith Collection:</strong> The core loop revolves around creation and guidance. Use divine powers to accelerate human development and cast miracles to ensure loyalty to Olympus, gathering Faith to empower your abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conflicts with Rival Faiths:</strong> Features intense battles for planar control. Beyond standard defenses, you will face unique scenarios such as the &quot;Invasion of the 12 Apostles&quot; and the &quot;Birth of Jesus,&quot; utilizing skills to respond to these threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creation &amp; Destruction:</strong> Combines simulation management with combat strategy. Experience the dual satisfaction of nurturing civilizations and crushing heretics through divine decision-making.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/ce4d598e6b85c97586b653b325d2cd2c.avif?t=1773208176\" width=431 height=128 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command nine Olympian deities, including Zeus, Hades, Apollo, and Ares. In each run, select three gods to form your unique divine council. Your choice defines how you intervene in the world: heal wounds and convert believers with Apollo\u2019s melody, resurrect the dead with Hades\u2019 power, or strike with Zeus\u2019 thunderbolts. These diverse synergies form the strategic foundation of every playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/8b2d1ffb31d9de7eb2741b3f0d01dee1.poster.avif?t=1773208176\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/8b2d1ffb31d9de7eb2741b3f0d01dee1.webm?t=1773208176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/8b2d1ffb31d9de7eb2741b3f0d01dee1.mp4?t=1773208176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/68ec23c0a079a74c2a990d4ff14f14e6.avif?t=1773208176\" width=431 height=128 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this randomly generated sandbox, every human is a unique individual with their own name and traits. You can play as a passive observer, watching them work and grow naturally, or actively intervene. Use divine powers to create resources, boost the population, or grant technological revelations, guiding your people from scattered settlements into fortified city-states.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/fe38bc99bf10fb5772d76b95e2280e5f.poster.avif?t=1773208176\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/fe38bc99bf10fb5772d76b95e2280e5f.webm?t=1773208176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/fe38bc99bf10fb5772d76b95e2280e5f.mp4?t=1773208176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/4345c45797122cff532323b509091b10.avif?t=1773208176\" width=431 height=128 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faith is the vital link between god and mortal. Perform miracles to inspire the populace, converting them into loyal believers to generate &quot;Faith.&quot; This resource is essential for unlocking and upgrading your divine abilities. Listen to prayers at your temples; answering these pleas allows you to activate powerful artifacts that grant global bonuses to your civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/ee5a1be120a0a92da4c043266cb55e89.poster.avif?t=1773208176\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/ee5a1be120a0a92da4c043266cb55e89.webm?t=1773208176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared